    "Add noodles, applesauce, vanilla, salt, cinnamon, and optional raisins/apricots.",
    "Mix well.",
    "Pour into a greased 9x13 or deep baking pan.",
    "Sprinkle cinnamon over the top.",
    "Bake for 1 hour at 350°F."
